{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28705","headline":"闻开江相国宋下世二首 一 · 杜牧","name":"闻开江相国宋下世二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"权门阴进夺移才，驿骑如星堕峡来。\n晁氏有恩忠作祸，贾生无罪直爲灾。\n贞魂误向崇山没，冤气疑从湘水回。\n毕竟成功何处是，五湖云月一帆开。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜牧","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_28705.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28705","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}